'''''Abutilon sachetianum''''' is a small tree only known from the [[Marquesas]]. The species is found in small subpopulations on the islands of [[Eiao]], [[Hatutaa]], [[Hiva Oa]], [[Mohotani]] and [[Nuku Hiva]].<ref name=IUCN/>

It is named in honor of the botanist [[Marie-Hélène Sachet]].

